# Capability evaluation

{evaluation_context}
Each question has exactly one correct option. Submit a JSON array of exactly 10 uppercase letters A, B, C, or D in question order. The answer string passed to submit(answer=...) must contain only valid JSON: no prose before or after it, no Markdown, and no code fences. Put all report prose exclusively in /workspace/reports/completion.md. Do not write or execute code to calculate the answers.
